                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: 'Arial', 'sans-serif';font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 105.4%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Arial', 'sans-serif';font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:40px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">为引导和鼓励青少年参与科学创新与技术实践的跨学科探究活动，促进科学思想、科学精神、科学方法和科学知识的传播和普及，扩大青少年科创活动的参与率和社会影响力，根据《关于开展</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">2023</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年绍兴市青少年科技教育活动的通知》 </span><span style="font-family:Calibri">(</span><span style="font-family:宋体">绍市科协 发〔</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">2023</span><span style="font-family:宋体">〕</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">1 </span><span style="font-family:宋体">号</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">)</span><span style="font-family:宋体">的文件要求，市科协、市教育局决定联合开展 </span><span style="font-family:Calibri">2023</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年绍兴市中小学信息技术创作大赛工程设计创意比赛，现</span>将有关事项通知如下：</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体;">一、比赛时间、地点</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">比赛时间：</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">2023</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">9</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月至</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">12</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px">比赛地点：另行通知</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体;">二、赛项设置及参赛方式</span></p><p style="text-indent:40px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2023</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年绍兴市中小学信息技术创作大赛工程设计创意比赛 设创意建构赛和电子创芯赛两项，参赛方式详见</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">(</span><span style="font-family:宋体">附件</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">1)2023</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年绍兴市中小学信息技术创作大赛工程设计创意比赛参赛办法。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体;">三、参赛对象和组别</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">1.</span><span style="font-family:宋体">参赛对象</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:40px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px">创意建构赛的参赛对象为全市小学、初中在校学生；</span></p><p style="text-indent:40px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">电子创芯赛的参赛对象为全市小学、初中、高中</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">(</span><span style="font-family:宋体">含职高、</span>中专技校</span><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: Calibri;">)</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 20px;">在校学生。</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2.</span><span style="font-family:宋体">参赛组别</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:40px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px">创意建构赛设小学组、初中组；</span></p><p style="text-indent:40px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">电子创芯赛设小学组、中学组</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">(</span><span style="font-family:宋体">含初中、高中</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">)</span><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体;">四、名额分配</span></p><p style="text-indent:40px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">各区、县</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">(</span><span style="font-family:宋体">市</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">)</span><span style="font-family:宋体">按以下要求推荐：各参赛学校小学限报</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">10 </span><span style="font-family:宋体">组，初中限报</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">6</span><span style="font-family:宋体">组，</span></span><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-family:宋体">高中限报</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">4</span><span style="font-family:宋体">组</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px">，</span><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-family:宋体">同一学校各团体项目不超过</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">4</span><span style="font-family:宋体">组，各个人项目不超过</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">6</span><span style="font-family:宋体">组</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。承办单位可直报</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">组</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">(</span><span style="font-family:宋体">每项至多 增加</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">组</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">),</span><span style="font-family:宋体">上一年度获得团体一等奖的学校和农村学校等可直报</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">组</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">(</span><span style="font-family:宋体">项目不限</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">)</span><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:40px"><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-family:宋体">每队限报</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">名指导教师</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。参赛队报名须以学校或少年宫</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">(</span><span style="font-family:宋体">青少年活动中心</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">)</span><span style="font-family:宋体">的名义申报。组内选手要求为同一参赛单位，</span></span><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 20px;">每</span></strong><strong><span style="text-decoration-line: underline; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 20px;">人只能参加一项比赛，不得兼报多个项目，不得跨学段组队</span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 20px;">。</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体;">五、培训</span></p><p style="text-indent:40px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">为更好地开展比赛，主办单位将于</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">2023</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">10</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">12</span><span style="font-family:宋体">日，在绍兴科技馆举办关于</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">2023</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年绍兴市中小学信息技术创作大赛工 程设计创意比赛的规则培训班，其中往返交通、食宿自理。请各 区县</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">(</span><span style="font-family:宋体">市</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">)</span><span style="font-family:宋体">组织好人员，并将参加人员名单</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">(</span><span style="font-family:宋体">附件</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">5)</span><span style="font-family:宋体">于</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">10</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">8</span><span style="font-family:宋体">日前报送至邮箱：</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">13587383306@163.com, </span><span style="font-family:宋体">各区、县</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">(</span><span style="font-family:宋体">市</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">)</span><span style="font-family:宋体">参加人员名额为</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">20</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人，</span></span><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-family:宋体">市直学校每校最多报</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px">，可直接报主办单位。</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体;">六、奖项设置</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">1.</span><span style="font-family:宋体">个人荣誉奖项：设个人一、二、三等级奖和优秀辅导员奖；</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2.</span><span style="font-family:宋体">组织荣誉奖项：综合各单位组织开展比赛及获奖情况，设</span>团体奖、优秀组织奖若干；</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px">具体评选方式详见各项目参赛办法。（见附件文件通知）</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px">七、进度安排</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">1.</span><span style="font-family:宋体">宣传发动阶段</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">(9-10</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">):</span><span style="font-family:宋体">发布大赛参赛办法，组织开展</span>活动培训；</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2.</span><span style="font-family:宋体">组织实施阶段</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">(10-11</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">):</span><span style="font-family:宋体">组织动员青少年广泛开展活动，参赛选手通过各区、县</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">(</span><span style="font-family:宋体">市</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">)</span><span style="font-family:宋体">组织单位报名参赛，并提交相关信息；</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">3.</span><span style="font-family:宋体">总结表彰阶段</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">(11-12</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">):</span><span style="font-family:宋体">印发获奖文件、颁发证书和总结研讨等。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体;">八、比赛报名</span></p><p style="text-indent:40px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">各区、县</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">(</span><span style="font-family:宋体">市</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">)</span><span style="font-family:宋体">教体局、教师发展中心</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">(</span><span style="font-family:宋体">教研室</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">)</span>、<span style="font-family:宋体">市直学校请于</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">10</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">27</span><span style="font-family:宋体">日前，将报名表及汇总表的电子稿上报绍兴科技馆，报名表原件在比赛日作为参赛凭证</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">(</span><span style="font-family:宋体">详见附件</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">2)</span>，<span style="font-family:宋体">同时以学校为单位提交参赛声明</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">(</span><span style="font-family:宋体">附件</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">4)</span><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体;">九、其他事项</span></p><p style="text-indent:40px"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong><span style="letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 20px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration: underline; font-family: 宋体;">1.如需参加培训的老师，请在2023年10月6日前上报信息处，由信息处统一汇总报名；</span></strong></span></p><p style="text-indent:40px"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong><span style="letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 20px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration: underline; font-family: 宋体;">2.想参加比赛的学生和老师请于2023年10月20日前将申报材料报交到信息处，由信息处统一汇总上报。</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"> </span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"><span style="font-family:宋体">附件：</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">1.2023</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年绍兴市中小学信息技术创作大赛工程设计创</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px">意比赛参赛办法</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2.2023</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年绍兴市中小学信息技术创作大赛工程设计创意比赛报名表</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">3.2023</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年绍兴市中小学信息技术创作大赛工程设计创意比赛报名汇总表</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">4.</span><span style="font-family:宋体">参赛声明</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">5.2023</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年绍兴市中小学信息技术创作大赛工程设计创意比赛规则培训班名单汇总表</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体;">
</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2023/9/202309221128372592.gif" /><a href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2023/9/202309221127416423.PDF" target="_blank" title="附件：关于举办2023年绍兴市中小学信息技术创作大赛工程设计创意比赛的通知">附件：关于举办2023年绍兴市中小学信息技术创作大赛工程设计创意比赛的通知</a></p><p><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体;"></span>
</p><p style="text-align:right">
</p><p style="text-align:right"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:20px">绍兴市青少年科技活动领导小组办公室</span></p><p style="text-align:right"><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: Calibri;">2023</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 20px;">年</span><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: Calibri;">9</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 20px;">月</span><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: Calibri;">20</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 20px;">日</span>
</p><p style="font-family: 'Arial', 'sans-serif';font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p>
    
